#N canvas 0 50 1200 900 10;
#X text 10 6 p8nav (pdoly8~): pad translator - presetstep <n> \, userstep <n> \, init \, save (left inlet) -> the instrument (left outlet) \; display <title> <value> (right outlet). Right inlet: the instrument's messages. User bank: p8user-bank.txt beside this file \, 64 slots \, read again before every userstep and save. Generated by common/tools/ctnav.py., f 100;
